<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>安全 on Hex Blog</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/tags/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 安全 on Hex Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><managingEditor>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</managingEditor><webMaster>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</webMaster><copyright>©2026, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hex-go.github.io/tags/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>DevOps-trivy-镜像扫描汇总</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-11-06-devops-trivy-%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E6%B1%87%E6%80%BB/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 10 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-11-06-devops-trivy-%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E6%B1%87%E6%80%BB/</guid><description>重要 trivy 用于扫描容器镜像的安全漏洞。 生产环境建议将漏洞库离线部署——将漏洞库打包进 Server 端镜像，内网独立运行。安全人员根据扫描结果升级基础镜像或 buildpack</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>DevOps</category><category>安全</category><category>Devops</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes 集群中以非 root 启动容器</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-06-28-docker-kubernetes%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9Eroot%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 11 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-06-28-docker-kubernetes%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9Eroot%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</guid><description>重要 容器默认以 root 运行，与宿主机 root 共享同一 UID 空间。一旦容器可访问宿主机资源，等同于宿主机 root 权限。 1. 问题 安全漏洞 CVE-2019-11245：容</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>安全</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>LDAP Python 操作库（ldap3）</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/python/20200108-ldap-python%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%93/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sun, 09 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/python/20200108-ldap-python%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%93/</guid><description>重要 ldap3 是 Python 操作 LDAP 的标准库。本文封装了常用操作类：连接、添加 OU/用户、查询、修改、删除（含递归删除子节点）。 环境说明 Python 3.7 ldap3 1. 安装 1 pip install ldap3 2. 完</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Python</category><category>安全</category><category>Python</category></item><item><title>LDAP 部署手册</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-08-ldap%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 07 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-08-ldap%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/</guid><description>重要 DN 是 LDAP 中一条记录的唯一标识，格式类似 cn=admin,dc=service,dc=corp。 1. 概念 术语 说明 示例 LDAP 轻量目录访问协议，树状结</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>DevOps</category><category>安全</category><category>Devops</category></item><item><title>Gogs集成LDAP</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-06-gogs%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90ldap/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 05 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-06-gogs%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90ldap/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 Gogs 支持本地账号 + LDAP 账号并存 LDAP 只是新增认证源，不会禁用本地管理员账号 绑定 DN 用于查询用户树 不建议使用 LDAP 管理员账号，建议创建只读查询账</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>DevOps</category><category>安全</category><category>Devops</category></item><item><title>Jenkins 集成 LDAP 认证</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-06-jenkins%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90ldap/</link><pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 03 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/devops/2020-01-06-jenkins%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90ldap/</guid><description>重要 Jenkins 集成 LDAP 后本地认证失效。保存配置前务必测试 LDAP 连接，否则配置错误会导致无法登录。解决：备份 config.xml，或在 &amp;lt;securityRealm&amp;gt; 中恢复为本地认证。 1.</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>DevOps</category><category>安全</category><category>Devops</category></item></channel></rss>